abstract: >-
  A notebook-first workflow for generating high-resolution digital surface
  models from Pléiades, Pléiades NEO, and SPOT 6/7 optical stereo imagery using
  the NASA Ames Stereo Pipeline, with integrated reference-DEM preparation,
  quality control, restartable processing, and optional co-registration.

keywords:
  - "Ames Stereo Pipeline"
  - "Pléiades"
  - "Pléiades NEO"
  - "SPOT 6/7"
  - "digital surface model"
  - "satellite photogrammetry"
  - "reproducible workflow"
